  {
    "id": "sp-interview-g1-01",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "g1",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Do you prefer to study alone or with other people? Explain why."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-g1-02",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "g1",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "What is a hobby you would recommend to a new student, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-g2-01",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "g2",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "How has technology changed the way people learn?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-g2-02",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "g2",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Is it better to live close to your school or farther away? Why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i1-01",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i1",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Let’s talk about how you study. Where do you usually study, and why do you prefer that place?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i1-02",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i1",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Some students study in the morning and others study at night. When do you study best, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i1-03",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i1",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Students take notes in different ways. Do you take notes by hand or on a device? Explain your choice."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i1-04",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i1",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Now, imagine a new student is starting at your university. What advice would you give about studying, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i2-01",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i2",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Let’s talk about life on campus. What is your favorite place on campus, and why do you like it?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i2-02",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i2",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Many students join clubs and student groups. Would you recommend joining a club? Why or why not?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i2-03",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i2",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Some students live on campus, while others live at home. Which do you prefer, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i2-04",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i2",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Universities are always looking for ways to improve. What is one thing you would change about your university, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i3-01",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i3",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Let’s discuss technology in education. How do you use technology to help you learn, and why is it useful?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i3-02",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i3",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Some classes are taught online, while others are in person. Which do you think is better, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i3-03",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i3",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "People often say that phones are changing student life. Do you think students depend too much on their phones? Explain your opinion."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i3-04",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i3",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Now, think about the future. How do you think technology will change universities, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i4-01",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i4",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Let’s talk about managing your time. What do you do to avoid wasting time during a busy week, and why does it work for you?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i4-02",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i4",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "People manage deadlines in different ways. Do you usually finish work early, or do you wait until the deadline? Why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i4-03",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i4",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Students often debate how long they should study at one time. Is it better to study for a long time at once or in short sessions? Explain why."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i4-04",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i4",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Sometimes everything seems to be due at the same time. What should students do when they have too many tasks, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i5-01",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i5",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Let’s discuss environmental responsibility. What can universities do to become more environmentally friendly, and why would that matter?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i5-02",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i5",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Some people think individual actions can protect the environment, while others believe only governments can make a difference. What is your view, and why?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i5-03",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i5",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Many eco-friendly products cost more than ordinary ones. Would you be willing to pay more for products that are better for the environment? Explain your reasoning."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sp-interview-i5-04",
    "task": "interview",
    "set": "i5",
    "kind": "interview",
    "lines": [
      {
        "sp": "Interviewer",
        "text": "Finally, think about children and nature. How can schools encourage younger children to care about nature, and why is it important to start early?"
      }
    ]
  }
]